1912+ 7CB3                  ; Punto 1: Top-Left (X, Y)
1913+ 7CB3 CD 7C 7C         call CheckNastyCell
1914+ 7CB6 38 38            jr   c, .collision
1915+ 7CB8
1916+ 7CB8                  ; Punto 2: Top-Right (X + 7, Y)
